{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5b858c6a-4b56-877a-8ad5-f7f2f6d4c52f",
  "created_at": "2026-01-14T14:46:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marco Mancini",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:44:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:44:27-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Walter. Marco Mancini. I've got a couple of questions about voting. Sorry, I'm in the car, I'm circling a lot looking for a place to park outside City Hall, so if I go quiet that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:44:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:44:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "First one, early voting. What are the dates? Is it open yet, or does it start closer to the election?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:44:50-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early voting only opens in the weeks before a specific election, so it depends on which one you mean. There's nothing open today. Once an election is scheduled, the dates and hours are posted on the city website and on the Secretary of State's site, and we can tell you here too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:45:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so nothing right now. Is there one coming up that you know of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:45:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd want to check the calendar to give you the right date rather than guess from memory. Can I put you on a short hold?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:45:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. I'm still going around the block anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:45:26-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for waiting. I've got it. The next scheduled election isn't close yet, and early voting for it will be announced about a few weeks ahead. If you'd like, I can note your number so someone calls when the dates are set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:45:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all right. I'll look online. Second question, what ID do I need? Do I have to bring a license, or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:45:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rhode Island asks for photo ID at the polls. A driver's license works, and so do other photo IDs like a passport or a student ID. If you don't have one, there are some other options, but you'd be asked to fill out a form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:46:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so license is fine. I've got that. And it has to be current?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:46:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally the ID can be expired, but I'd double-check the exact wording with the Board of Canvassers if yours is. I can transfer you if you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:46:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, mine's current. I'm good. Oh, a spot just opened up. Thanks, Walter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:46:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Mancini. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
